      GlobalTheory.IndefiniteRowSideFullHecke.WeilTensorModels.Acts (GlobalTheory.IndefiniteRowSideFullHecke.WeilTensorModels.evI F) (om (1, γ (Multiplicative.ofAdd t))) ⇑f ⇑(T t f)) →
